    that of ``x``:

    >>> x = jnp.array([[2, 1, 5],
    ...                [3, 4, 7],
    ...                [1, 3, 5]])
    >>> jnp.polyval(p, x)
    Array([[ 19,   8,  76],
           [ 34,  53, 134],
           [  8,  34,  76]], dtype=int32)

